        <td bgcolor="#c7b19c" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;09 Apr 2001&nbsp;:&nbsp; 18:02:33</font>

        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=125"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        
        &nbsp;<a href="JavaScript:openWindow('pop_messengers.asp?mode=ICQ&ICQ=8192292&M_NAME=Abyn')"><img src="http://online.mirabilis.com/scripts/online.dll?icq=8192292&img=5" height=15 width=15 alt="Send Abyn an ICQ Message" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        &nbsp;<a href="JavaScript:openWindow('http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=ken%5Fm%5Fa&.src=pg')"><img src="icon_yahoo.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Send Abyn a Yahoo! Message" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        &nbsp;<a href="JavaScript:openWindow('pop_messengers.asp?mode=AIM&AIM=kabayanNPC&M_NAME=Abyn')"><img src="icon_aim.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Send Abyn an instant message" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        &nbsp;<a href="post.asp?method=TopicQuote&TOPIC_ID=981&FORUM_ID=8&CAT_ID=2&Forum_Title=The+Chapel&Topic_Title=Armor+of+Ro"><img src="icon_reply_topic.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Reply with Quote" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Even though I'm not a palidan.  I thought that since there are several that are attempting this quest, I should write up a short concise thingee, like i did for magicians epic</P><P>Helm of Ro:<BR>Given by Paladin Thomas.<BR>Faction:  Temple of Thunder in Qeynos [Knights of Thunder].<BR>Give: Skulls from the undead cyclopses. (lvl 31-35)<BR>Receive: Mold for the helm. </P><P>Gauntlets of Ro: <BR>Given by Sentry Joanna.<BR>Faction needed with the Temple of Marr in Freeport [Priests of Marr].<BR>Bring her the locket from Sentry Alechin of Qeynos (get when he is werewolf form at night - may be called Grimtooth) (lvl 31-35)<BR>Receive: mold for the Gauntlets. </P><P>Greaves of Ro:<BR>Given by Paladin Elisabeth [Half Elf Paladin].<BR>Faction:  Hall of Truth in Freeport [Knights of Truth].<BR>Give: Head from a Nightfall Giant (West Commonlands - spawns at the druid ring right at nightfall) (lvl 35-37)<BR>Receive: Mold for the greaves.</P><P>Breastplate of Ro:<BR>Given by Paladin Abigail.<BR>Faction needed with the Clerics of Tunare in Felwithe.<BR>Give: 2 Dark Cauldrons (from the cooks in Mistmoore) (lvl 31-35)<BR>Receive: Mold for the breastplate. </P><P>Vambraces of Ro:<BR>Given by Paladin Marianna.<BR>Faction needed wtih the Temple of Life in Qeynos [Priests of Life].<BR>Give: 2 rotten shark portions (diseased shark skins?) from plague sharks (oceans around Qeynos Hills/not in Eruds crossing) Debateble..but In Erud’s Crossing.<BR>Receive: Mold for the vambraces. </P><P>Bracers of Ro:<BR>Given by Paladin David [Erudite Paladin].<BR>Faction needed with the Erudite Paladin's Guild [Deepwater Knights].<BR>Give: 2 Goblin Nets from the elusive goblin net masters/deepwater goblin netmasters (the waters of Lake Rathe)<BR>Receive: Mold for the Bracer </P><P>Boots of Ro:<BR>Given by Paladin Nicolas [Dwarf Paladin].<BR>Faction:  The Dwarf Paladin's Guild [Miners Guild 249].<BR>Give: The plans for the Brazen Brass Kilij from a Sand Giant in South Ro<BR>Receive: Mold for the boots. <BR> </P><P><BR>To get Rhonium<BR>Ingredients: (Assume All No Drop)<BR>1. MM Granite: (Gargoyles in MM)<BR>2. Melatite (Clockworks Sol A)<BR>3. Sands of Ro (Sand Giants)<BR>4. Soil of Underfoot (See Quest Below)<BR>5. 2 enchanted PP bars.</P><P>Fourth the Soil of Underfoot is a quest from Kaladim, the priestess Ghalea in the Cleric guild. TO get the item your after you will need 4 fairy Dusts which can be found easy enough in Lfay from the Fairy camp.</P><P>Last is the enchanted PP which well....you have to buy from a vendor and have an enchanter enchant them.</P><P>Give all this to Lord Searfire the Dwarven Smith in Sol Temple. He will give you a Bar of Ronium. </P><P>Take the Bar of Ronium and go to the local forge and place the bar of ro and the Mold (also a quest) and place into a forge and combine...you dont need but one skill point in Smithing to get it to succeed. THis was part of the change in the late patches. There is rumor..."I dont know if its true and I wont risk finding out" that you can give the mold and the bar of ro to the Dwarf Smith and he will combine it for you and you will have your armor....again thats a rumor as far as I know.</P><P>Marcielle Chevalier<BR>Paladin of Marr Knight of the Burning Sheild<BR>Brell Serillis </P><P><BR>Abyn<BR>Ele"mental"ist of the 52nd circle</P><P> </font></td>
